 "brief_title": "Efficacy and Safety of Exenatide Once Weekly Suspension in Subjects With Type 2 Diabetes",
 "official_title": "A Randomized, Open-Label, Long-Term, Parallel-Group, Comparator-Controlled, Multicenter Study to Compare the Glycemic Effects, Safety, and Tolerability of Exenatide Once Weekly Suspension to Exenatide Twice Daily in Subjects With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus",
